# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Termnova — Environment Configuration Template
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Database (PostgreSQL + pgvector) ──
# Local default port: 5432, Docker default port: 5433
DB_USER=aditya
DB_PASSWORD=
DB_NAME=termnova
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://aditya@localhost:5432/termnova
DATABASE_URL_SYNC=postgresql://aditya@localhost:5432/termnova

# ── Redis Cache & Session Store ──
# Local default port: 6379, Docker default port: 6380
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# ── Request Authentication (disabled | api_key | oidc) ──
# Keep disabled only for local development. Use OIDC for interactive production access.
AUTH_MODE=disabled
# OIDC_ISSUER=https://your-idp.example.com/
# OIDC_AUDIENCE=termnova-api
# OIDC_JWKS_URL=https://your-idp.example.com/.well-known/jwks.json
# OIDC_ALLOWED_ALGORITHMS=RS256
# OIDC_ORGANIZATION_CLAIM=org_id
# OIDC_ROLES_CLAIM=roles
# OIDC_JWKS_MIN_REFRESH_INTERVAL_SECONDS=10
# Interim service-account mode only; use a generated secret of at least 24 characters.
# API_KEY=
# API_KEY_SUBJECT=termnova-service-account
# API_KEY_DISPLAY_NAME=Termnova Service Account
# API_KEY_ORGANIZATION_ID=local
# API_KEY_ROLES=service

# ── LLM Provider Configuration (openrouter | openai | bedrock | ollama | mock) ──
LLM_PROVIDER=openrouter
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-openrouter-key-here
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# ── Recommended Ultra-Low Cost / Free OpenRouter Models ──
# 1. google/gemini-2.0-flash-001 (Recommended: ultra fast, ~$0.10/M tokens)
# 2. google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free (100% Free on OpenRouter)
# 3. meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free (100% Free on OpenRouter)
# 4. deepseek/deepseek-chat (Extremely cheap: ~$0.14/M tokens)
# 5. qwen/qwen-2.5-72b-instruct (Cheap & highly capable legal reasoning)
LLM_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-001
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
EMBEDDING_DIMENSION=1536

# ── RAG Pipeline Parameters ──
CHUNK_SIZE=512
CHUNK_OVERLAP=64
MIN_CHUNK_SIZE=50
TOP_K_RETRIEVAL=10
RELEVANCE_THRESHOLD=0.3
BM25_K1=1.5
BM25_B=0.75
RRF_K=60

# ── Application Runtime ──
APP_ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
UPLOAD_DIR=data/uploads
MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB=50
CORS_ORIGINS=["*"]
